// DECLARATION OF INTENT
// Gold border box with signature line

#set page(paper: "a5", margin: (inside: 30mm, outside: 15mm, y: 25mm))
#set text(font: "EB Garamond", size: 11pt, leading: 1.5em)

#v(1cm)

#align(center)[
  #text(font: "Playfair Display", size: 20pt, weight: "bold")[Declaration of Intent]
  
  #v(0.3cm)
  
  #text(size: 14pt)[◈ · ✦ · ◈]
]

#v(1cm)

Before you descend into the garden, you must make a pact with yourself. This is not a contract of perfection—it is a commitment to presence. You are not promising to "fix" yourself. You are promising to _witness_ yourself.

#v(0.5cm)

#rect(stroke: 1.5pt + rgb("#D4AF37"), inset: 20pt, width: 100%, radius: 3pt)[
  #align(center)[
    #text(font: "Playfair Display", size: 14pt, weight: "bold")[My Sacred Commitment]
  ]
  
  #v(0.5cm)
  
  I, #box(width: 4cm, stroke: (bottom: 0.5pt + black)), commit to meeting my shadow with curiosity instead of judgment.
  
  #v(0.3cm)
  
  I will move at my own pace. I will rest when I need to rest. I will not force excavations my nervous system is not ready for.
  
  #v(0.3cm)
  
  I understand that shadow work is not about becoming perfect. It is about becoming _whole_.
  
  #v(0.3cm)
  
  I give myself permission to feel what I feel, to name what I name, and to bring home what has been exiled.
  
  #v(0.5cm)
  
  #align(center)[
    #text(size: 12pt)[❧]
  ]
  
  #v(0.5cm)
  
  *Signature:* #box(width: 5cm, stroke: (bottom: 0.5pt + black))
  
  #v(0.3cm)
  
  *Date:* #box(width: 3cm, stroke: (bottom: 0.5pt + black))
]

#v(1cm)

#align(center)[
  #text(font: "EB Garamond", size: 10pt, style: "italic")[
    _"One does not become enlightened by imagining figures of light,_
    
    _but by making the darkness conscious."_
    
    — C.G. Jung
  ]
]
